WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:07.260 size:78% align:center
Today, AI is forcing us to change the way we work to stay competitive.

2
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:13.090 size:78% align:center
The question we should all be asking isn't whether to use AI at work,

3
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:17.700 size:78% align:center
but where and how to bring it in, so it makes sense and boosts productivity.

4
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.160 size:78% align:center
Bringing it into your workflow means delegating repetitive tasks

5
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.700 size:78% align:center
and work that needs attention 24/7,

6
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.600 size:78% align:center
connected to the tools you use every day: your email, inventory, invoicing,

7
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.510 size:78% align:center
video and content creation.

8
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:36.740 size:78% align:center
All of this in one place: an AI agent you can talk to like a person,

9
00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.510 size:78% align:center
and hand tasks it completes in seconds.

10
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.630 size:78% align:center
The integration and the hard part are on me.

11
00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:45.020 size:78% align:center
You don't need to have it all figured out: tell me what you need,

12
00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.880 size:78% align:center
or the idea you have in mind,

13
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.970 size:78% align:center
and I'll design the architecture and the integration around you,

14
00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:56.870 size:78% align:center
answering the key questions: How do I make my workflow more productive?

15
00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:01.460 size:78% align:center
How do I make my products and services more appealing? And above all:

16
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.470 size:78% align:center
how does AI grow my profits?

17
00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:09.130 size:78% align:center
So… will you get into the AI race, or stay out?
